        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Where's Officer Tuba?, Look Out, Officer!\n- People: Philip Chan, Ricky Lau, Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung, Joey Wong\n- Roles: film directors, actors, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Where's Officer Tuba? is a 1986 Hong Kong action comedy film.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? was directed by Philip Chan and Ricky Lau.\n- Where's Officer Tuba? stars Sammo Hung, David Chiang, Jacky Cheung, and Joey Wong.\n- Joey Wong Cho-Yee, also known as Joey Wang, Wang Tsu Hsien, or Joey Ong Jyo Han/Hen, was born on January 31, 1967.\n- Joey Wong is a Taiwanese-born actress based in Hong Kong.\n- Look Out, Officer! starred Sammo Hung.",
